    WL-0:  55136B,  256 colors, vs PNG 45586B (1.209x)
    WL-1:  55136B,  256 colors, vs PNG 45586B (1.209x)
    WL-2:  55136B,  256 colors, vs PNG 45586B (1.209x)
    WL-3:  55136B,  256 colors, vs PNG 45586B (1.209x)

